              bone pavers, and hexagon walkway mats across Dubai and the UAE. We provide
              heavy-duty surfaces built to protect animal hooves, reduce garden path
              maintenance, and endure harsh climate conditions.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="/contact" class={`${primaryCta} focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal-700`}>
                Request Free Material
              </a>
